1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Man drops from the sky into a pristine, sunlit prehistoric landscape. Smiling casually, he steps forward and immediately crushes an innocent insect underfoot without looking down, signaling an intrinsic disregard for non-human life.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Walking through vibrant grassland, he encounters a snake. He grabs it, violently flays its skin while it writhes, and wears the reptile's skin as fashionable boots.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Encountering a flock of wild chickens, he captures them and stuffs them into high-density industrial battery cages. He injects them with chemical growth hormones, rapidly converting living birds into pre-packaged fast-food fried chicken buckets.

4
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:51.000
He approaches a peaceful seal basking on an icy shoreline. Without hesitation, he beats the animal to death with a club, strips its pelt on the spot to fashion a fur coat, leaving behind a bloody skeleton.

5
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:03.000
A majestic charging bull enters the scene. Man waves a red matador cape, drives swords into the creature for sport and entertainment, and butchers it into cuts of steak.

6
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:16.000
A giant elephant approaches in self-defense. Man subdues the beast instantly with high-tech weaponry, cuts off its ivory tusks, and converts the majestic mammal into a luxury piano and ornamental furniture.

7
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Transitioning to marine ecosystems, man launches industrial super-trawlers equipped with colossal nets, vacuuming millions of fish, dolphins, and turtles from the ocean depths.

8
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:42.000
He captures sharks, slices off their dorsal fins for shark-fin soup, and callously tosses the bleeding, paralyzed predators back into the ocean to suffocate and die.

9
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Advancing inland, man deploys giant mechanical chainsaws and bulldozers, clearcutting millions of acres of ancient old-growth rainforest, reducing biodiverse ecosystems to barren mudfields.

10
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:08.000
In place of the cleared forests, he constructs colossal industrial factories, refineries, and paper mills that spew thick, pitch-black toxic smoke into the atmosphere.

11
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Industrial manufacturing surges into hyper-drive, mass-producing mountains of disposable plastic items, electronics, and consumer commodities while spewing radioactive green runoff into dead waterways.

12
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Cities rapidly metastasize into sprawling concrete megalopolises. Dense highway networks clog with gas-guzzling automobiles under a sky suffocated by photochemical smog.

13
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:47.000
The Earth's surface is transformed into an apocalyptic landfill wasteland. The natural biosphere is entirely erased, smothered beneath plastic debris, rusted machinery, and animal carcasses.

14
00:02:47.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Man ascends to the summit of an immense mountain of trash and animal skulls. He sits triumphantly upon a golden throne labeled "Welcome," wearing a glittering crown, puffing a thick cigar, smiling proudly over his kingdom of garbage.

15
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:12.000
The orchestral tempo of Grieg’s "In the Hall of the Mountain King" accelerates to a chaotic frenzy. Suddenly, the sky darkens as a colossal alien flying saucer descends through the smog.

16
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:22.000
A giant three-eyed extraterrestrial emerges. Man gazes upward in momentary confusion and vulnerability, suddenly realizing his absolute helplessness before a superior apex predator.

17
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Without hesitation, the alien lifts its colossal foot and violently stomps down, crushing the man into red paste against the concrete—mirroring the exact gesture with which man crushed the bug in the opening scene.

18
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.000
The alien picks up the squashed man's skin, drapes it over its shoulders as a fashionable human-skin fur coat, steps back into the spaceship, and departs the decimated planet. Final credits roll.
